# Offline & sync

- Base URL: RemoteConfig (`api_base_url`) then fallback `admintts.../api`.
- Sync failure → keep local list/files; never bulk-delete on network error.
- Download to `*.part` → validate size + MP3 header (`ID3` / frame sync) → rename.
- Skip re-download only if hash matches **and** file is valid; delete corrupt leftovers.
- `pinActiveAudio`: validate source; copy via temp rename; never pin corrupt bytes to `active_*.mp3` / boot copies.
- Offline OK after first successful login+download; fresh install needs network once.
- DNS / host lookup errors are sync-only — they do not stop local MediaPlayer.
